      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s library, now called the Cochrane Rockville Library, was founded in the early 1900s by author Thomas Nelson Page in memory of his wife and has recently doubled in size.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        14,
        15,
        16,
        19,
